# Folder library

Canonical: [`.cursor/saved/folder-library/BRIEF.md`](../saved/folder-library/BRIEF.md)  
Format badges: [`.cursor/saved/folder-library/FileCard.original.tsx`](../saved/folder-library/FileCard.original.tsx)

## Product

- **`[+]` menu (folder + document):** Attachments · Image (not blind create into current tab).
- **Tabs:** All · Images · Attachments.
- **Image:** tag + **Prompt** + optional WebP; detail switch + copy prompt + download; **wallColor** on preview pane.
- **`--prompt--` capture** in the document editor: name the ficha, save prompt-only to the document library, open detail to copy.
- **Attachments** (category `skill` / `pdf`): tag + description + downloadable file; open → Download.
- **Video create retired** — no Video in `[+]` or tabs (legacy `video` fichas may still open from All).
- **Document sub-library:** fichas on the node; folder overlay **Folder | Docs** toggle only if a child doc has fichas (subfolder per doc).
- **Document sets (live):** `/i` creates a set (name + story) on **this document**; `/o` lists sets and opens Folder | Images | Attachments; assign loose fichas (`setId`) from the same doc. Actions, not blocks. No folder sets. No main reuse / `element.set` yet.
- Bytes → `doc-images`. Metadatos → `campaigns.library_items` (folder) · `nodes.library_items` + `nodes.library_sets` (document).

